# The Gradle wrapper IS tracked, unlike the Flutter template default.
#
# The template ignores gradlew, gradlew.bat and gradle-wrapper.jar. That is
# fine when every checkout runs `flutter create .` first, and fatal otherwise:
# a fresh clone has no wrapper, and `flutter build apk` invokes
# android/gradlew directly, so the build dies before it starts. Tracking the
# wrapper is also what pins Gradle 9.3.1 for everyone rather than leaving it to
# whatever is on the machine.
/.gradle
/captures/
/local.properties
GeneratedPluginRegistrant.java
.cxx/

# Remember to never publicly share your keystore.
# See https://flutter.dev/to/reference-keystore
key.properties
**/*.keystore
**/*.jks
